        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\angle AOB\\approx2.6$ radians; using the graphical estimate, $r\\approx154$ m.",
          "worked": "Using $\\theta\\approx1.3$ from the graph,\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\angle AOB&=2\\theta\\\\&\\approx2.6\\text{ radians}.\\end{aligned}$$\nThe arc length formula gives\n$$\\begin{aligned}l&=r\\alpha\\\\400&\\approx r(2.6)\\\\r&\\approx\\frac{400}{2.6}\\\\&\\approx154\\text{ m}.\\end{aligned}$$",
